    "intro": {
      "type": "lps-split",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "About the membership",
        "heading": "Learn the principles, not just the recipes.",
        "heading_size": "md",
        "text": "<p>Premium Learning is designed for people who want to understand how fragrance works. You will study raw materials individually and in combination, learn the laboratory habits that make results accurate and repeatable, and develop the judgement to compose and refine your own formulas.</p><p>Lessons are recorded, so you can learn at your own pace and return to any topic as your practice develops. Alongside them, formula studies, exercises, live sessions and a focused community help you put each idea into practice.</p>",
        "list_style": "plain",
        "button_label": "Read the full learning overview",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/premium-learning",
        "button_style": "link",
        "image_brief": "Editorial photograph: a student at a bench evaluating a smelling strip, a laptop showing a lesson beside a rack of amber dilutions. Portrait.",
        "image_alt": "A perfumery bench with amber bottles and jars of raw materials",
        "media_position": "left",
        "media_width": "equal",
        "tone": "ivory",
        "padding_top": 96,
        "padding_bottom": 96,
        "image_stock": "bench-still-life"
      }
    },
